title: Authorizations › New Case › Intake › Patient, insurance and request rows
route: /authorizations/new/:draftId (Intake, the onboarding form)
intro: The form of patient onboarding, one card in three sections and a folded More. Every field writes straight into the draft; nothing needs saving. An import, a referral, a verification or a known patient fills the fields, and every one stays editable. Required fields carry an asterisk; nothing is blocked here, and Review & submit lists what is missing.
dir: TD
---
start s1 "Intake is open on an initial or a retroactive authorization"
start s2 "'Continues in' from Payers or Eligibility & Benefits:\na new payer or a verification fills the coverage"

group gPat "Patient"
  input iIni "Type 'Initials' (upper case, at most 8 characters)"
  input iDob "Pick 'Date of birth'"
  process pAge "Age is worked out from the date of birth on the demo day and shown beside it\nThe age box is then read only"
  input iAge "A draft that has only an age (from a referral) keeps its age, editable"
  input iSex "Pick 'Sex': Female, Male, Other or not stated"
endgroup

group gCov "Coverage"
  input iPayer "Pick 'Payer'"
  process pPlans "'Plan type' offers the payer's own plans, the first one picked\nSummit: HMO. Beacon: PPO, HMO, EPO. Harborview: Medicare Advantage, D-SNP"
  input iPlan "Pick another 'Plan type'"
  input iMem "Type 'Member ID'"
endgroup

group gReq "Request"
  input iLoc "Pick 'Level of care': Residential 3.5, IOP, PHP, Detox"
  input iType "Pick 'Request type': Initial request or Admission\nA retroactive request records Retro-authorization and shows no choice"
  input iStart "Pick 'Requested start date'\nRetroactive: 'First date of service' and 'Last date of service'"
  input iDx "Search 'Primary diagnosis (ICD-10)' by code or name, pick one\nThe first chip is the primary"
  input iSite "'Site': Site A or Site B with both sites in view\nOne site in view, or a case with its id: the site name only"
endgroup

group gMore "More, folded"
  click cMore "Click 'More'\nIts summary names what is filled, e.g. 'Referral source'"
  input m1 "'Secondary insurance': None or a payer, then its member ID"
  input m2 "'Requested end date': empty asks for the usual length"
  input m3 "'Attending clinician' and 'Clinician NPI' (10 digits, else '10 digits')"
  input m4 "'Referral source' (a referral fills it with the organization and the clinician)"
  input m5 "'Guardian': initials and relationship, only when the patient is under 18"
endgroup

store st "Each change is written to the draft at once\nAfter the agents ran, a change clears their work"
toast tStale "'Records changed after the agents ran'\n'Their work was cleared. The agents check again when you continue.'"
screen sMark "A field an import filled says 'From EMR', 'From file' or 'From screenshot' under it\nuntil the person changes it"
process pState "The Intake state on the stepper follows\nComplete once patient, payer, service and dates are in"
goto gImp "Continues in: Authorizations › New Case › Import › Review what was found and apply"
goto gSite "Continues in: Authorizations › New Case › Sites and scope"
goto gStates "Continues in: Authorizations › New Case › Step states"

s1 --> iIni --> iDob --> pAge
s1 --> iAge
iDob --> iSex
s1 --> iPayer --> pPlans --> iPlan --> iMem
s2 --> iPayer
s1 --> iLoc --> iType --> iStart --> iDx --> iSite
iSite -.-> gSite
s1 --> cMore --> m1 & m2 & m3 & m4 & m5
iIni --> st
iSex --> st
iMem --> st
iDx --> st
m5 --> st
st -.-> tStale
st --> pState -.-> gStates
s1 -.-> sMark -.-> gImp
